Music: Apache Theme (sample) supplied by the mod author.
Music: Humvee Theme "Armored Perimeter" supplied by the mod author.
Warning tones, the ground-threat radio alert, the mortar whistle, radio call, radio squelch and alarm sounds are synthesized for this mod.
The Humvee rev and the Humvee cold start (starter motor synthesized, the catch built from the engine recordings) use the kyles engine recordings above.
